      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "12. A: Nǐ hǎo a?                            How are you?\n    B: Wǒ hǎo. Nǐ ne?                       I'm fine. And you?\n    A: Hǎo, xièxie.                         Fine, thanks.\n\nNotes on No. 12\n\nThe marker ne makes a question out of the single word nǐ, \"you\": \"and you?\" or \"How about you?\"\n\nXièxie is the verb \"to thank.\" \"I thank you\" would be Wǒ xièxie nǐ. Xièxie is often repeated: Xièxie, xièxie.\n"
    }
